[[Wolf Slayer]] is a [[Slayer|Slayer Quest]] that involves killing [[Wolf|wolves]] to spawn the [[Sven Packmaster]]. The player must first defeat the {{SlayerTier|2}} [[Tarantula Broodfather]] to unlock '''Wolf Slayer'''. See [[Slayer]] for specifics.

